FILE EXTENSION - there are 3 types of file extension recognised by VIEWTEXT    
which will affect the transmit mode. If the extension is .PGE (the default),   
the entire file is sent to the modem. The V                   
@ send this ! *** wait 3 seconds @ then        The layout is for a 40 column   
send this \ and this bit on a new line !       page, and contains 4 fields     
